    title: 'Continue › Connect',
    url: 'https://github.com/crossmart-io/crossmart/blob/main/docs/developers/agents/continue.md#connect',
    text: "Add to `~/.continue/config.yaml`, or create a block file in `.continue/mcpServers/` (a block file\nalso needs top-level `name`, `version` and `schema`):\n\n```yaml\nmcpServers:\n  - name: Crossmart\n    type: streamable-http\n    url: https://mcp.crossmart.io/mcp\n    requestOptions:\n      headers:\n        x-api-key: cm_…\n```\n\nContinue documents `${{ secrets.NAME }}` only inside `env`, so whether it works in headers is also\nunconfirmed. If the server answers `401`, the header is not being sent; please\nopen an issue with your Continue version.\n\nContinue › Check\n\nThe MCP section of Continue's settings lists **Crossmart** and its tools in agent mode.",
