    url: 'https://github.com/crossmart-io/crossmart/blob/main/docs/developers/agents/windsurf.md#connect',
    text: 'Add the server to `~/.config/devin/mcp_config.json` (user) or `.devin/mcp_config.json` (project;\nuse `.devin/mcp_config.local.json` to keep the key out of git):\n\n```json\n{\n  "mcpServers": {\n    "crossmart": {\n      "url": "https://mcp.crossmart.io/mcp",\n      "transport": "http",\n      "headers": { "x-api-key": "cm_…" }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe docs document `${env:VAR}` only for OAuth fields, so paste the key itself here and keep the file\nprivate.\n\nWindsurf (Devin Desktop) › Check\n\nOpen Cascade\'s MCP panel and refresh: **crossmart** lists its 25 tools.',
